{"title":"邀 请 函","date":"2019-03-05","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体\">邀 请 函<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">真挚地邀请您拨冗出席由广东省项目管理协会主办、甲骨文股份有限公司承办和永道科技有限公司协办于<span lang=\"EN-US\">2019</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">14</span>日在广州粤海喜来登大酒店举办的建筑科技高峰论坛。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span>本次论坛主题为<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>未来智领，建筑慧变<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;&nbsp;</span>系面向建筑与工程行业的交流峰会，届时业内精英将与广东省项目管理协会客座信息化专家、甲骨文公司专家一起，共同探讨数字化如何推动建筑与工程行业发展，交流项目管理的发展趋势，分享建设领域的实践案例。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">我们将同与会宾客一起探讨在改革开放<span lang=\"EN-US\">40</span>周年的新时代背景下，项目管理的信息化与数字化将如何推动建筑与工程行业的发展，以及现代化的项目管理解决方案将如何助力现代化工程项目管理。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">会议期间，您不但可以与会同行专家深入探讨，更能分享到下列精彩内容：</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">&bull;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">科技赋能工程行业数字化转型。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">&bull;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">建筑与工程行业的发展现状与趋势。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">&bull; </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">甲骨文建筑与工程全球事业部如何引领行业发展。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">会议期间，您可以与国内外优秀同行深入联谊，拓展人脉。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">协会致力帮助会员在工程项目管理的数字化变革中提升项目管控能力和投资回报能力，在全球市场中获得更大成功。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">恭候您的莅临！</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n宋体\">附：</span></span><a href=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/files/cms/article/201903/%E5%8F%82%20%20%E4%BC%9A%20%20%E5%9B%9E%20%20%E6%89%A7%20%20%E8%A1%A8(2).docx\"><span style=\"color:#3366cc;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n宋体\">参加会议回执</span></span></a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:150%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:28.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0;\r\nline-height:150%\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(89, 195, 249)\">\r\n\t<section _editor=\"bj.96weixin.com\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; box-shadow: rgb(221, 221, 221) 0px 3.2px 3.2px 0px; background-color: rgb(89, 195, 249); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"font-size: 18